-- #1111 A-2.5b -- THE DISCRIMINATING CELL for review finding F1, and the reason it
-- lives HERE rather than in test/llvm_fixtures_modules/.
--
-- F1: the method-export index was a `CrossRun` field, and `elaborateModules`' promotion
-- arm opens with a SECOND `resetCrossModuleState ()`, which swapped in a fresh (empty)
-- bundle.  The final elaboration sweep then ran with no index, every candidate missed,
-- and the overlay fell back to the pre-#1092 floor.  Symptom: `check` exit 0 with zero
-- diagnostics while `run` and `build` BOTH exit 1 saying *"type error ... Run 'medaka
-- check' for details"* -- the surface the error names reports nothing.
--
-- WHY THIS CORPUS.  This gate grades check/run/build EXIT-CODE AGREEMENT against
-- `.expected`, with the REAL PRELUDE, and requires a `.out` value pin on ACCEPT.  That
-- is exactly F1's shape.  The sibling cell in `test/llvm_fixtures_modules/` CANNOT see
-- it and is labelled non-discriminating there: that corpus's probe
-- (`entry_support.runEmitWith`) emits WITHOUT gating on type errors, and its impl
-- mangling omits the interface (`@mdk_impl_Blob_msmth`), so with one impl of `msmth`
-- for `Blob` the emitted IR is byte-identical whichever interface the obligation was
-- recorded against -- measured, md5 equal across the fix.
--
-- WHAT MAKES IT REACH THE BUG: `twice` is UNSIGNATURED and CONSTRAINED, so it is
-- directly promoted, `promotionHarvestRef` is non-empty, and `elaborateModules`
-- DISCARDS #194's single bare sweep and re-runs through the reset-bearing arm.  Every
-- promotion-FREE fixture in this unit takes the fast path and stayed green while `run`
-- and `build` were broken.
--
-- EXPECTED VALUE DERIVED BY HAND: `msmth` reaches this module only through
-- `lib.a25b_mid`, which re-exports `lib.a25b_ifb`'s, so both occurrences mean
-- `MSIB.msmth`; this module implements exactly that interface.  `twice Blob` is
-- 7 + 7 = 14.  `.expected` is ACCEPT because that is the CORRECT verdict and the one
-- this branch produces; at `$BASE` and at the pre-F1-fix tip it is not.
import lib.a25b_mid.{MSIB, msmth}
import lib.a25b_ifa.{MSIA}

data Blob = Blob

impl MSIB Blob where
  msmth b = 7

twice x = msmth x + msmth x

main : <IO> Unit
main = println (twice Blob)
